    <div class="cst-shell cst-shell--text">
      <p class="cst-caveat" id="honest-h" style="max-width:60em"><b>READ THIS FIRST.</b> Unsmoke is a self-directed concept. It was never engineered or released, so there is no analytics, no retention curve and no controlled comparison anywhere on this page. The one outcome I can point to — eight people who told me they cut down or stopped — is self-reported by a group I recruited myself. It is an anecdote, and I have labelled it as one. What follows is the design argument and the reasoning behind it.</p>
